Fletching		KEY:Peerless Archer ~ Fletching					CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Supernatural	DESC:You can create magic arrows with +%1 enhancement bonus|FletchingBonus		DEFINE:FletchingBonus|0	BONUS:VAR|FletchingBonus|1			ASPECT:NAME|Fletching +%1|FletchingBonus
Power Shot		KEY:Peerless Archer ~ Power Shot	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialAttack.Extraordinary		DESC:Before making an attack roll, you can reduce your attack bonus to increase your damage bonus.  
Threaten		KEY:Peerless Archer ~ Threaten		CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialAttack.Extraordinary		DESC:At 8th level, a peerles archer gains the ability to threaten nearby areas with her bow, as if she were wielding a melee weapon when wearing light armor or no armor. She loses this special ability when fighting in medium or heavy armor. Her bow functions as a reach weapon, threatening anything 10 feet away but not immediately adjacent to her. Any attacks of opportunity she recieves because she threatens nearby areas are normal ranged attacks, and these count against her maximum number of attacks of opportunity per round.
